<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθ-ερία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>freedom, liberty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.62
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθερίας φῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					809
				</span></i>
			(lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				863
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἐλευθερίας μόλις
				ἐξῆλθες</span>, i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόλις
				ἠλευθερώθης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1509
			</span></i>(anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπῆρξαν ἐλευθερίας τῆ Ἑλλάδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.142
				</span></i>
			; <i>freedom from</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ πασῶν ἀρχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					698a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					329c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.228
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adaeus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>manumission</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰκοστὴ τῶν
			ἐ</span>.,= Lat. <i>vicesima manumissionum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				326ii 11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>licence</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκολασία καὶ
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				492c
			</span></i>; of Diogenes, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.185c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> later, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθεριότης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				62.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> name of a
				<i>dance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.293
			</span></i>.</div>
